{"title":"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_the_Power_of_Logic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by the Power of Logic</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers of apples growing on each of six apple trees form an arithmetic sequence where the greatest number of apples growing on any of the six trees is double the least number of apples growing on any of the six trees. The total number of apples growing on all six trees is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567408c6043bd6b51ad0c5d1cab9ff67f6253274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$990.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> Find the greatest number of apples growing on any of the six trees.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the arithmetic sequence, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the first term and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the common difference, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/4/a442ab65f0eeafb8ea058b5ecaeaec4ec5009ce4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d&gt;0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> The sum of the first six terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f8aeca3955d001532722393e1fc38cfd900cbbb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+(a+d)+(a+2d)+(a+3d)+(a+4d)+(a+5d) = 6a+15d.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />\nWe are given that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f57a74cb82c0b7cde4632c70e25997f698b3acd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 6a+15d &amp;= 990, \\\\ 2a &amp;= a+5d. \\end{align*}\" width=\"146\" height=\"39\" />\nThe second equation implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6ab7da48d6d76f49fedf2bde2993dce14c971ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5d.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> Substituting this into the first equation, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f05c1bc148521c57bf1cd764b0c32e9db1340d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 6(5d)+15d &amp;=990, \\\\ 45d &amp;= 990 \\\\ d &amp;= 22. \\end{align*}\" width=\"146\" height=\"63\" />\nIt follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13a4763302c55005223c29962be2e996bceff17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=110.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"68\" height=\"14\" /> Therefore, the greatest number of apples growing on any of the six trees is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c164b924bbe61380a0c435317342853bf9939785.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+5d=\\boxed{220}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"120\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the terms in the sequence be defined as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e65f57f79b98b0ebbeb36be340162b45a2c3e81.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1, a_2, ..., a_6.\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"11\" /> \n</p><p>Since this is an arithmetic sequence, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b23572835c3e7575e6243457c761225dff60fe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_6=a_2+a_5=a_3+a_4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"224\" height=\"15\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f54a6d7b6ffbceab3e69e3a23a474668f3b48737.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^6 a_i=3(a_1+a_6)=990.\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"50\" /> Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0363090d33763fff2a3049c7b7994cc8e079fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1+a_6)=330.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" /> And, since we are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/70239f6a54386706985a37439639d3f1e4cef427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6=2a_1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c7b11153a9b28e080c11449b1f34cdd9c32394e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a_1=330\\implies a_1=110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31a09f3157666aa31a41d4d58d6c1c511111f564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6=\\boxed{220}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"87\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Kiran\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nNhfDCX5-bw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nNhfDCX5-bw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_the_Power_of_Logic\">Video Solution 2 by the Power of Logic</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by the Power of Logic\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VcEulZ3nvSI\">https://youtu.be/VcEulZ3nvSI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II\" title=\"2023 AIME II\">2023 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2023\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Associatio